   "type": "heading",
   "text": "Stop 4: Does the chart tell the truth?"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "markdown": "Charts can help us, but some can **mislead** us. An honest chart has a clear title, labels on both sides, and bars that start at zero.\n\nA chart that starts at a big number can make a small difference look huge."
  },
